Begin "Add selenium to physicians dept"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Access" charttab 
	Click the "Access Control" charttab subtab
	Type "Selenium" in the input 
	Click the "Go!" button
	Gridclick "Username:selenium" "Edit" grid link
	Check the "Physicians" checkbox
	Click the "Submit" button 
Begin "Login as butler"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the Logout sidemenu entry
	@Setup WCTestSession for butler@driver.wcutils.insertWCTSession('butler')
Begin "Add task regarding Selenium"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Task List" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Add New Task" link
	Type "Test regard provider" in the "Description" input 
	Type "test notes" in the "Notes" input
	Select "Chart" from the "regard_type" dropdown
	Enter "Selenium" into the "Regarding" autocomplete 
	Enter "03-20-2025" in the "Due Date" date
	#Enter "Physicians" in the 'le_task_assign_realm_display' autocomplete
	#@Wait@driver.wcutils.waitForAJAX(30)
	#Click the "Add" listedit button
	#Click the "Add Task" button 
	Select "Physicians" from the 'realmDropdown' dropdown
	Click the "Assign" button
	Check the "assignToMyself" checkbox
	Click the "Save" button
	Wait for ajax
Begin "Check task"
	Verify exists "test notes" text
	Begin "log in as selenium"
		Open the sidemenu
		Click the Logout sidemenu entry
		@Setup WCTestSession for Selenium@driver.wcutils.insertWCTSession('{selenium_username}')
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Task List" sidemenu entry
	Verify exists "Physicians" text
	Verify notexists "test notes" text